Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:06.07,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Now listen up, Kobato…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.07,0:00:09.11,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,The summer vacation is our rival, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:11.07,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Rival, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:13.41,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right! With a summer vacation you have…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.41,0:00:14.49,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Beaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.49,0:00:15.32,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Bug collecting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:16.50,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Watermelon splitting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:22.30,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,There are just too many ways it can distract you from helping those who are hurting…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:23.88,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you listening, Dobato?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Notice TS,0000,0000,0000,,[yellow]Summer Festival Notice; [white] Cherry Tree Park}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.41,0:00:28.83,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.83,0:00:31.85,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not a letter! It’s a flier! A flier!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:38.84,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I don’t need to tell you that collecting confetti will be a constant struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:41.23,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Especially with summer festivals being such formidable enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Notice TS,0000,0000,0000,,same as above}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:44.30,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Flutes, drums and yukatas at temple festivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:46.33,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And then there are the Bon dances.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.33,0:00:47.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They look beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:48.61,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.61,0:00:50.11,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Now listen up, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:53.96,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,You'd better understand what I’m trying to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.63,0:01:00.93,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,We’re not done talking here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.23,0:01:03.29,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I won’t give in to the summer festivals!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:07.15,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I will heal everyone whose hearts are hurting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,{OP}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Title TS,0000,0000,0000,,…Summertime Memories.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Notice TS,0000,0000,0000,,same}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.49,0:02:48.12,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,A summer festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:52.86,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Where did it go, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.85,0:02:55.11,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Do you mean this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:57.63,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! That’s it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.58,0:03:00.80,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:02.84,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.49,0:03:04.79,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Here, use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:05.29,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.90,0:03:07.82,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Your hands are all wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:12.06,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:15.55,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What is she up to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:18.55,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a flier for a summer festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.96,0:03:21.59,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,It {\i1}is{\i0} the season for them, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.59,0:03:23.38,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Have you ever gone to one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:25.06,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Every year since I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.55,0:03:28.33,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Ported shrines and fireworks at the temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:29.62,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,“Fire-flowers…”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:33.69,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:37.03,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I might not go this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.03,0:03:39.02,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:41.78,KM,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, let’s have a race at the pool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.78,0:03:44.09,KM,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, and I’m not going to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.39,0:03:47.83,KM,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah? But, you know, I’ve\Ngotten better at swimming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.83,0:03:49.32,KM,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.05,0:03:52.73,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I have to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:54.42,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,High schools are still in session today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:57.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Preschool is on summer break!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.09,0:03:57.87,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:03.01,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Ow…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:04.37,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.41,0:04:08.02,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Na-chan! Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:13.53,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,You were too busy looking at\Nyour cell-phone, weren’t you? {Keeper: orig line "You were walking while focusing on your cellphone again, weren’t you?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.89,0:04:16.21,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,If you keep messing around, you’ll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:24.87,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.87,0:04:26.17,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,{Uh-huh!}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.16,0:04:32.38,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Ko-ba-tooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.22,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,My body feels h-heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.55,0:04:43.18,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that better?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:44.13,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not better!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:47.10,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,No sooner had I warned you, than you fell for the summer festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:48.23,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Stay right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.23,0:04:50.13,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to make you feel the heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:04:59.06,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Dry me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.79,0:05:04.17,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That uniform is from Sena Girls’ Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:07.99,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So you know Nachan-san, Fujimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.99,0:05:08.58,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.20,0:05:11.32,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,It’s the high school annexed to the women’s college.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.32,0:05:13.88,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,It’s Sayaka-san’s and Chitose-san’s alma mater.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.88,0:05:16.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You know so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:19.19,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a school for upper-crust girls. Not for girls like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.19,0:05:21.53,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He is being mean today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.53,0:05:23.71,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Since he’s on break from the preschool,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:27.21,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,he’s probably overly busy with work and studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:28.37,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.37,0:05:30.19,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,In any case, I’m dry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.19,0:05:31.35,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,You’re giving that back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:33.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Sign TS,0000,0000,0000,,Sena Girls’ Academy}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:48.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Nachan-san isn’t anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:50.58,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry it up before it gets dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.39,0:05:55.89,KM,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,I would like to make an announcement before you all leave for summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:54.58,KO,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.89,0:05:58.27,KM,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Mizuhashi Natsuki-san has been recognized,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.27,0:06:02.38,KM,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,for her beautification work with the\Nvolunteer club where she represents us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:06.58,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,We’ve received a thank-you letter\Nfrom the prefecture for her efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:12.58,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So Nachan-san's name is Mizuhashi Natsuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:15.05,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And that stumbling girl is in the same class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:19.16,KM,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Take care not to stay up too late during summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.16,0:06:20.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,From this morning…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.72,0:06:22.46,KM,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,And take care not to slack off either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:26.66,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,The students from Sena Academy are\Nexpected to maintain a certain standard…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Blackboard TS,0000,0000,0000,,[left] Clean-up; [right]Pool}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:29.66,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Morikawa-san! You again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:32.17,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Shape up or it will be confiscated!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.49,0:06:33.47,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,So{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.99,0:06:35.71,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.71,0:06:40.09,KM,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Now then, we will be confirming your\Nemergency contacts for summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:42.09,KM,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, nice picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:42.09,KO,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,If anything were to happen…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.09,0:06:44.47,KM,Haruna,0000,0000,0000,,You really have an eye for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:46.04,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:47.96,KM,Haruna,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, have a little pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.35,0:06:49.54,KM,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:55.43,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Please gather by the side of the pool for clean-up duty. {Keeper: orig line "Please gather by the side of the pool for its clean-up."}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.43,0:06:56.50,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,They’re coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:06:58.52,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:05.70,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:09.47,KM,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Are you a student here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:13.87,KM,kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No. I’m Hanato Kobato from Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.87,0:07:16.19,KM,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Preschool? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.19,0:07:19.29,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,You there, please call for the clerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:21.80,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it all. Kobato, run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:23.99,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.99,0:07:25.63,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:27.80,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I’ll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:29.73,KM,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.73,0:07:31.07,KM,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:36.67,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,In any case, we have to find Natsuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.37,0:07:43.25,KM,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,Are you holding the lens correctly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:45.57,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Real ones are great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.57,0:07:48.95,KM,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t it about time you bought yourself one, Yukino-chi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:53.18,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:56.00,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,That girl was with Na-chan this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:08:00.03,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So your name is Yukino-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.03,0:08:00.93,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:03.37,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Hanato Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.49,0:08:09.73,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Na-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.15,0:08:16.10,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,This girl needs to see you for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.53,0:08:18.44,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, we met this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.44,0:08:22.33,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I, Hanato Kobato, have come to return your hankerchief!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.89,0:08:27.15,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,You even washed it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.15,0:08:29.91,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. But since I don’t have an iron,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:32.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,it’s all wrinkled. I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:34.03,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,That’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.03,0:08:35.31,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.35,0:08:38.58,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well, I’ll be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:40.79,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What about the pool cleaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:45.16,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I haven’t told you this,\Nbut I have a part-time job now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:48.42,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,But this school doesn’t\Nallow us to work part-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:51.61,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I know that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:54.99,KM,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino-chi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:54.99,KO,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:08:58.97,KM,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry we’re late!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:00.20,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.20,0:09:02.00,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Na-chan, I’m really sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:03.04,KM,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:06.98,KM,Haruna,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino-chi is working to buy a new camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.87,0:09:12.37,KM,Wakuna,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll be taking her place for the\Npool-cleaning, so please don’t tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:16.44,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.53,0:09:22.17,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me, Natsuki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.31,0:09:26.77,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I-I will join you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Sign TS,0000,0000,0000,,Mizuhashi}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.63,0:09:32.13,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It is just as Fujimoto-san said!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:37.13,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,This place is not like ours at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:42.42,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Still, nobody uses “I will\Njoin you!” as a pick-up line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.42,0:09:45.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,“Pick-up line?” People don’t do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.61,0:09:49.36,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to make you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:52.10,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um. I’m sorry for using a pick-up line!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:53.52,KM,Iryogi,0000,0000,0000,,{Jesus Tapdancing Christ…} {Keeper: lol}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.79,0:09:59.13,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I actually didn’t want to go home alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:00.88,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,so I was happy you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:03.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then that’s great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:07.38,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,That photograph…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:11.72,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,That looks like Yukino-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.25,0:10:15.99,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,It was taken during a summer\Nfestival while we were in grade school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:18.47,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You two are very close!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:21.16,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you can say we {\i1}were{\i0} close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:24.59,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So you two aren’t close right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.28,0:10:27.51,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.51,0:10:29.75,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,…Yukino has grown distant from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:35.13,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Na-chan, good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.13,0:10:37.20,KP,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Yukino-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:39.13,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Your shirt is sticking out in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:41.41,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’ll fix it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:46.92,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,We used to go to school together every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:50.09,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for being so late!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:52.34,KP,Natuski,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino-chan, you’ve got really bad bedhair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.34,0:10:54.28,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,You’re kidding! Hold on for a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.91,0:10:58.85,KP,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino-chan, hurry back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:01.94,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And then, at some point…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:05.81,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Na-chan, I overslept! Go on without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.81,0:11:07.45,KP,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:11.03,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And then, when we got to\Nhigh school, we just slowly…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:13.46,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,And then… huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.49,0:11:15.99,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,That’s beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:21.91,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Na-chan. Go ahead without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.91,0:11:23.81,KP,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Um, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:30.54,KP,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino-chan, if you’re so interested in photography, then join our club!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:33.68,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,But for me to join a club…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:36.64,KP,Haruna,0000,0000,0000,,Now don’t be like that.\NWhy not just have a look-see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.64,0:11:37.69,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.69,0:11:39.39,KP,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,It’ll be fine, don’t worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:44.79,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Now recently, we’ve grown completely apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.57,0:11:54.37,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I don’t know what Yukino\Nis thinking about anymore…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,{eyecatches}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:19.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I want to help Natsuki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.09,0:12:20.59,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.59,0:12:22.14,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.43,0:12:26.07,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,600)}What do you mean you don’t know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:31.11,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I have to go meet with Yukino-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{signs TS [standing sign],0000,0000,0000,,Summer Festival Grounds Headquarters; [on tent] Yomogi Shops}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.57,0:12:36.11,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Good job there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.47,0:12:39.36,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,We should be able to make it for the festival now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:40.31,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{candy TS,0000,0000,0000,,Mikan}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.93,0:12:48.67,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Take whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.67,0:12:51.58,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m very sorry for disturbing you at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:54.87,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all right. I’m done anyway, so don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.87,0:12:56.66,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.66,0:12:58.30,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve saved up enough money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:13:01.65,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And I’ll be going to the sale at the station\Nbuilding tomorrow to finally buy my camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.65,0:13:04.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So the one you had yesterday wasn’t yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.35,0:13:05.34,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:07.49,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,460)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.49,0:13:09.47,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,That was a friend’s.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.47,0:13:12.79,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I want my own so much that I’ve been working for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:15.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s amazing, Yukino-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.00,0:13:18.23,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I originally got interested when I was taking pictures with my cell-phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.23,0:13:19.57,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Now I’m completely hooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:22.42,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I made friends with some\Ngirls in the Photography Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:24.42,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,There’s so much we can talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.42,0:13:25.83,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What about Natsuki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:30.51,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,You haven’t been talking to Natsuki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.11,0:13:35.46,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Na-chan was… an old friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:40.42,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,They match!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:41.34,KP,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:44.72,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, let’s go buy straps.\NI think they should match too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:48.35,KP,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,But if the straps match too, we can’t tell them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.75,0:13:49.98,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,You’re right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KP,{Sign TS,0000,0000,0000,,Strap Corner}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:54.09,KP,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.09,0:13:55.86,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Then, I’ll take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.49,0:13:58.03,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’ll take a watermelon, since I’m Natsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.03,0:14:00.07,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,And since I’m Yukino, I’ll have a snowman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.36,0:14:03.37,KP,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Too cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.14,0:14:05.61,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Why don’t we trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:06.73,KP,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.29,0:14:09.95,KP,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I will treasure it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:12.12,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll treasure it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:20.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So you’re no longer close with Natsuki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:23.80,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Have you come to hate her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:28.01,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I would never… I could never hate Na-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.65,0:14:30.97,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I wish I could be Na-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:34.58,KP,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Stop that, you’re embarrassing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:38.05,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Say, let’s take one together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.05,0:14:39.08,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:42.49,KP,Both,0000,0000,0000,,All right, cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.66,0:14:45.88,KP,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Next time we should take a real one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:48.95,KP,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Then you should get better at taking pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.09,0:15:07.78,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I think Natsuki-san and Yukino-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:11.04,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,...really want to be close to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:13.60,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Why can’t they be close like they used to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:15.08,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:18.96,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If they don’t even know,\Nhow could {\i1}we{\i0} possibly know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.36,0:15:23.50,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But... I want to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{sign TS,0000,0000,0000,,[bottom left] Yomogi Station; [top right] Summer Sale}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.33,0:15:31.81,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me! Where is the\Ncamera seller for this sale located?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.81,0:15:33.10,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,If you’re looking for that…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.10,0:15:34.12,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.23,0:15:39.28,KM,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, since you bought it, why don’t you try it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.28,0:15:40.75,KM,Haruna,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.06,0:15:44.52,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Oh… Na-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:46.05,KM,Natuski,0000,0000,0000,,Out shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:47.37,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Uh… yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Bag TS,0000,0000,0000,,Yamada Cameras}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.28,0:15:50.24,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,It’s a single-lens reflex camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.92,0:15:52.99,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:59.25,KM,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yukino-chi has been working hard\Nat her job to buy this great camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.25,0:16:00.16,KM,Haruna,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:02.79,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Even us in the photography club are jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:05.50,KM,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino-chi, you should really join our club!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:07.41,KM,Haruna,0000,0000,0000,,That would be awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.41,0:16:09.95,KM,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,Do it to commemorate your single-lens debut!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.95,0:16:12.48,KM,Haruna,0000,0000,0000,,Especially since you bought the camera of your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:13.45,KM,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.45,0:16:15.31,KM,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,Next time, let’s go to a photography exhibition!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:18.43,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,You’re sure to take some\Ngood pictures with your talent!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:19.61,KM,Haruna,0000,0000,0000,,{Uh-huh! Uh-huh!}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.61,0:16:20.21,KM,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.21,0:16:21.02,KM,Haruna,0000,0000,0000,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:22.50,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,This is idiotic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:30.28,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I could see that you were good enough... if you were taking pictures for ads.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:32.61,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,But too many people have it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.22,0:16:35.85,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Yukino, can’t you see the mistake you’re making?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:40.66,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,You’re just some no-talent amateur who thinks she’s a pro. You’re despicable!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{bag TS,0000,0000,0000,,same as above}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.95,0:16:48.59,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.59,0:16:49.99,KM,Wakana,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Bag TS,0000,0000,0000,,same as above}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.13,0:17:03.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.54,0:17:14.04,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I think it would be great if I had the talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.04,0:17:16.60,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,But all I have now…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.09,0:17:18.75,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,...is my joy of taking pictures…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:21.16,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,...and my love for cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.15,0:17:26.62,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um… uh… It’s great that you bought the camera you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{bag TS,0000,0000,0000,,ibid}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.62,0:17:27.41,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,From there{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.41,0:17:28.25,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.39,0:17:32.68,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I want to be alone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.68,0:17:33.94,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.25,0:17:44.21,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Why did I blurt out those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:49.46,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,It’s gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:50.97,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,The strap is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.97,0:17:52.17,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.60,0:18:00.04,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.29,0:18:05.65,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. Where are you going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.65,0:18:09.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki-san was not being very nice back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:11.15,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,So I need to say something to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.15,0:18:13.07,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:17.58,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Well… anyway, things cannot continue on like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{door sign,0000,0000,0000,,Mizuhashi}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.81,0:18:28.46,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,May I ask what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:32.53,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,It’s gone! The strap is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:34.96,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I will help you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.45,0:18:39.35,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,I already searched through\Nthose, and I still can’t find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:41.72,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.25,0:18:44.66,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I was so cruel to Yukino.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.66,0:18:46.86,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,So that’s why it’s gone missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.15,0:18:49.81,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,In any case, I’ll look for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.37,0:18:57.78,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:19:01.25,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I… I…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.69,0:19:13.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.98,0:19:25.61,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.98,0:19:29.88,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:40.63,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:43.64,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.29,0:19:52.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You and Yukino-san really {\i1}are{\i0} still close, aren’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.41,0:19:57.40,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino is probably afraid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.41,0:20:05.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Perhaps that made all her efforts so wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.28,0:20:09.70,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,700)}Yukino…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:11.69,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,has always been peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:15.92,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Then, slowly, I felt us drifting further apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:19.38,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I was really afraid that she’d leave me for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:26.06,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,That’s why I focused my efforts on my studying and other stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.77,0:20:31.49,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,But I was the one who grew apart…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.49,0:20:33.41,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,…from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:39.96,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Natsuki-san. Could you\Npossibly lend me your telephone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,[Cell TS,0000,0000,0000,,[blue field, white letters] NOTICE; [white field, black letters] New E-mail: 1/Na-chan; [bottom, white box]Options}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.55,0:20:52.94,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Na-chan…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Cell TS,0000,0000,0000,,[blue field, white letters] Main Folder; [beside envelope] Na-chan; [cream field, black letters] Subject: I’m Sorry!; [blue letters]Attached Files: 1; [boxes left to right]Settings; Options; Menu}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Cell TS,0000,0000,0000,,Same}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Cell TS,0000,0000,0000,,Displaying}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Cell TS,0000,0000,0000,,[bottom boxes left to right] E-mail; Save; Menu]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.17,0:21:09.53,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Na-chan…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:12.05,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,You still have it…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.18,0:21:15.62,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.66,0:21:23.62,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino… I was really mean to you earlier…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.62,0:21:24.81,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:28.35,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,We’re the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:39.79,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Look… I’ve also been keeping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:42.48,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yukino…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.76,0:21:49.28,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve also always been keeping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:59.63,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Have you ever fought with\NChitose-san, Sayaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.93,0:22:04.69,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Have we fought? Only so\Nmany times that I’ve lost count!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.69,0:22:07.04,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, did we really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.04,0:22:11.20,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,How many times have we\Nrefused to speak to each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.65,0:22:14.81,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right. It did happen sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:18.17,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But you two are still close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.36,0:22:21.21,KM,Yukino,0000,0000,0000,,Na-chan, smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.53,0:22:24.21,KM,Natsuki,0000,0000,0000,,What? You’re embarrassing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.37,0:22:26.73,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,{Ah!}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.69,0:22:36.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The fireworks are beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.04,0:22:40.48,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Today you get 90 points, so take it, you thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.53,0:22:42.47,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:45.76,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The fireworks are beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.76,0:22:48.75,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell are you doing getting cheered up by the summer festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.75,0:22:51.48,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,That’s it! I’m giving you minus 200 points, Dobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:54.37,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The fireworks are beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.37,0:22:56.72,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell! Listen to me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.72,0:22:59.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1200)}So beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Next Title TS,0000,0000,0000,,The Organ And The Boy Upon That Day}
